            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jenny"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My daughter loves gnocchi, and I was looking for a new sauce to make for it. This was really good. I had a jar of olive tapenade (from Trader Joe's) open, so I used some of that in place of sliced olives. Everyone liked it! Thanks!",
